          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow the houses where a digit has exactly two spots, and color the cells along them alternately in two colors. One color holds the digit everywhere, the other nowhere. If two cells of the same color see each other, that color is the false one. A cell that sees both colors can't hold the digit.": {
      "comment": "Technique guide (detailed hint explanation and training)",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follow the houses where a digit has exactly two spots, and color the cells along them alternately in two colors. One color holds the digit everywhere, the other nowhere. If two cells of the same color see each other, that color is the false one. A cell that sees both colors can't hold the digit."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bir rakamın tam iki yeri olduğu birimleri izle ve bu hücreleri sırayla iki renge boya. Renklerden biri rakamı her yerde alır, diğeri hiçbir yerde. Aynı renkteki iki hücre birbirini görüyorsa yanlış olan o renktir. İki rengi birden gören bir hücre rakamı alamaz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow the houses where a digit has two spots, hopping between them through cells that see each other.": {
      "comment": "Technique guide (detailed hint explanation and training)",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follow the houses where a digit has two spots, hopping between them through cells that see each other."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bir rakamın iki yeri olduğu birimleri izle ve birbirini gören hücreler üzerinden aralarında atla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Follow the strong links of %lld: in each linked house it fits in only two cells, so exactly one of them is %lld. Coloring the cells alternately gives two groups, and exactly one group holds %lld.": {
      "comment": "Hint walkthrough page: Simple Coloring chain",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Follow the strong links of %1$lld: in each linked house it fits in only two cells, so exactly one of them is %2$lld. Coloring the cells alternately gives two groups, and exactly one group holds %3$lld."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld için güçlü bağları izle: bağlı her birimde yalnızca iki hücreye girebiliyor, yani bunlardan tam biri %2$lld. Hücreleri sırayla iki renge boyayınca iki grup çıkar ve %3$lld bu gruplardan yalnızca birinde olur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
