    "Suppose %lld at %@ is false. Following the links, every second candidate must then be true, up to %lld at %@. So at least one of the two ends is true.": {
      "comment": "Hint walkthrough page: chain reasoning; start digit and cell, end digit and cell",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suppose %1$lld at %2$@ is false. Following the links, every second candidate must then be true, up to %3$lld at %4$@. So at least one of the two ends is true."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%2$@ hücresindeki %1$lld yanlış olsun. Bağları izleyince her ikinci aday doğru olmak zorunda; bu %4$@ hücresindeki %3$lld adayına kadar sürer. Yani iki uçtan en az biri doğru."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suppose every cell of one color holds %lld.": {
      "comment": "Visual proof, Simple Coloring: a case",
      "localizations": {
