    "Twin pairs joined by a link": {
      "comment": "Technique subtitle",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Twin pairs joined by a link"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bağlı İkiz Çiftler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two almost locked sets": {
      "comment": "Technique subtitle: ALS-XZ",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two almost locked sets"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "İki Neredeyse Kilitli Küme"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two cells have the same two candidates, X and Y, but don't see each other. If X fits in only two cells of some house, one seeing each of them, then one of the two cells must be Y. A cell that sees both can't be Y.": {
      "comment": "Technique guide (detailed hint explanation and training)",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two cells have the same two candidates, X and Y, but don't see each other. If X fits in only two cells of some house, one seeing each of them, then one of the two cells must be Y. A cell that sees both can't be Y."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "İki hücrenin adayları aynı (X ve Y) ama birbirlerini görmüyorlar. Bir birimde X yalnızca iki hücreye giriyorsa ve bunların her biri bu hücrelerden birini görüyorsa, iki hücreden biri Y olmak zorundadır. İkisini birden gören bir hücre Y olamaz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two cells of the same color see each other, so that color can't hold %lld. %lld can be removed from all its cells.": {
      "comment": "Hint walkthrough page: Simple Coloring, color wrap",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two cells of the same color see each other, so that color can't hold %1$lld. %2$lld can be removed from all its cells."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aynı renkteki iki hücre birbirini görüyor, yani o renk %1$lld olamaz. %2$lld o rengin tüm hücrelerinden silinebilir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two cells, two digits": {
      "comment": "Subtitle for the Naked Pair technique",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two cells, two digits"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Açık İkili"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two colors along strong links": {
      "comment": "Technique subtitle: Simple Coloring",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
